WEBVTT

00:02:27.949 --> 00:02:32.753
the government actually convicts
an inanimate object with a crime.

00:02:33.628 --> 00:02:36.763
It's as if that thing itself
committed the crime.

00:02:37.227 --> 00:02:41.952
That's why civil forfeiture cases
have these really peculiar names,

00:02:41.976 --> 00:02:47.548
like, "The United States of America
v. One 1990 Ford Thunderbird."

00:02:47.572 --> 00:02:49.363
(Laughter)

00:02:49.713 --> 00:02:55.061
Or "The State of Oklahoma
v. 53,234 Dollars in Cash."

00:02:55.085 --> 00:02:56.179
(Laughter)

00:02:56.203 --> 00:02:58.186
Or my personal favorite:

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:02.065
"The United States of America
v. One Solid Gold Object